            Have questions or feedback? We'd love to hear from you.
        </p>
        <address>
            <strong>Support:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@films.com">support@films.com</a><br />
            <strong>Marketing:</strong> <a href="mailto:marketing@films.com">marketing@films.com</a>
        </address>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
